 "font_size": 14,
 "html": "<style>\r\n    .asset-qr-container {\r\n        width: 100%;\r\n        text-align: center;\r\n        padding-top: 30px;\r\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .asset-title {\r\n        font-size: 24px;\r\n        font-weight: bold;\r\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .asset-details {\r\n        font-size: 14px;\r\n        color: #555;\r\n        margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .qr-code {\r\n        margin: 20px auto;\r\n        width: 220px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .qr-code img {\r\n        width: 220px;\r\n        height: 220px;\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    .scan-text {\r\n        margin-top: 15px;\r\n        font-size: 13px;\r\n        color: #666;\r\n    }\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"asset-qr-container\">\r\n\r\n```\r\n<div class=\"asset-title\">\r\n    {{ doc.name }}\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n{% if doc.asset_name %}\r\n    <div class=\"asset-details\">\r\n        {{ doc.asset_name }}\r\n    </div>\r\n{% endif %}\r\n\r\n<div class=\"qr-code\">\r\n    <img\r\n        src=\"https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=300x300&data={{ frappe.utils.get_url() }}/app/asset/{{ doc.name | urlencode }}\"\r\n        alt=\"Asset QR Code\"\r\n    >\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"scan-text\">\r\n    Scan to open Asset\r\n</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n",
